OL,3,GNEWSATeenager sought after boy, 13,
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for help tracing a
OL,7,Fteenager after a 13-year-old boy was
OL,8,Fstabbed in Leeds.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Roundhay Road
OL,11,Fjust after 18:00 BST on Bank Holiday
OL,12,FMonday, following reports a boy had
OL,13,Fbeen attacked. He was taken to hospital
OL,14,Fwith a non-life-threatening wound to
OL,15,Fhis abdomen, West Yorkshire Police
OL,16,Fsaid.
