OL,3,GNEWSATeenager sought after boy, 13,
OL,4,Astabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA male, about 15 to 16 years old, who
OL,7,Fwas wearing a balaclava and who was
OL,8,Fwith two girls, was being sought by
OL,9,Fofficers in connection with the
OL,10,Fincident, a West Yorkshire Police
OL,11,Fspokesperson said.
OL,13,FAppealing for witnesses, Det Ch Insp
OL,14,FScott Hartley said: "Although this was
OL,15,Fa serious incident, our inquiries so
OL,16,Ffar suggest it was an isolated and
OL,17,Ftargeted act."
